{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46四期生の"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又春です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobs0rh5s.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトルにもあるように、\nちょうど1年前の今日、四期生がミーグリに初参加しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "First Showcaseのお見送り会でお話しする機会はあったものの、本当に一瞬だったので、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それよりも少しゆったり、まったりとお話しできるミーグリを、ずっと楽しみにしていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて参加した日のことは今でも覚えていて、\n休憩時間に四期生で「えめっちゃ楽しい〜！」ってテンションが普段の何倍も上がっていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして当時は6部あるうちの2部だけの参加で、\n「もう終わりか〜」って、帰るのが名残惜しかったです🥲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今では全ての部に参加させていただけるようになって、たくさんお話しできるようになったし、お会いできる方も増えました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも、あの頃も今も変わらず、一人ひとりとの時間、一つひとつの会話が私にとって大切な宝物です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも本当にありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみにこれを読んでくださっている方の中にも、ちょうど1年前の今日、私と初めて話したという方もいるのかな...？👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1年前の私、めっちゃ緊張してたよね、笑\nそんな中で優しく話しに来てくれてありがとう😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "___"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、一昨日！\n6/27 オンラインミーグリありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobweHCyN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "黒いワンピースと黒いリボン"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コインランドリーの黒衣装に寄せてみた！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOdPGLV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7GVT91.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全身は少し赤目になっちゃった笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は、初めて来てくださった方も多かった気がする！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもっともっと仲良くなりたいな〜💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後は\n次の日のリアルミーグリにも来てくださる方と「また明日〜」ってご挨拶できたのもなんか特別感あって嬉しかった🤭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミーグリのこととか、先日MVが公開された四期生楽曲「We got your back」のこととか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話したいことがたくさんあるので\nまたすぐブログに書くね！🌿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOXwc56.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobRdZHin.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobh3lF0Y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#41"}], "source": "official"}